<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Exam Preparation</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fff4f4;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .step {
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 12px 0;
            background: #fafafa;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .important {
            padding: 15px;
            background: #fff3cd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🎯 Exam Preparation Guide</h1>

    <p>
        A simple guide to help students prepare for examinations
        in an organized way.
    </p>

    <div class="step">
        <h3>Step 1 — Understand the Syllabus</h3>
        <p>Check all chapters and topics included in the examination.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <h3>Step 2 — Create a Revision Plan</h3>
        <p>Divide your available study time between different subjects.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <h3>Step 3 — Study Important Concepts</h3>
        <p>Focus on understanding concepts instead of memorizing everything.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <h3>Step 4 — Practice Questions</h3>
        <p>Solve questions to test your understanding.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
        <h3>Step 5 — Revise</h3>
        <p>Review important formulas, definitions and notes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="important">
        <strong>Remember:</strong>
        Stay organized and give yourself enough time to prepare.
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
